10. AI Data Quality Agent

Rather than simply detecting:

email = NULL

AI can understand why the data quality problem exists.

For example:

Event: customer_registered


Expected:
email
phone
customer_id


Actual:
email
phone_number

AI says:

phone_number is probably semantically equivalent to phone. The event schema appears to have changed between application versions.

Then:

Root Cause:
Mobile App v4.2 introduced "phone_number".


Impact:
17% of events no longer comply with the tracking plan.


Recommendation:
Map phone_number → phone
and update instrumentation.

That's much more valuable than a simple data-quality rule.

